<title>USA: Roosevelt Financial Q3 oper net down.</title>
<headline>Roosevelt Financial Q3 oper net down.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.44		    $0.50</p>
<p> Oper shr dil	     $0.42		    $0.47</p>
<p> Oper net		  19,722		   21,497</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 operating earnings exclude $17.8 million, or $0.38 a share charge to recapitalize Savings Association Insurance Fund. Including the SAIF charge and one-time charges connected with early extinguishment of debt, the company had net loss of $548,000, or $0.01 a share, in the quarter.</p>
</text>
